OL,3,GNEWSAPioneering gene editing transforms
OL,4,Ateenager's life
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager has revealed how her life
OL,7,Fhas been transformed thanks to
OL,8,Fpioneering gene editing, which reversed
OL,9,Fsymptoms of a crippling blood disorder.
OL,11,FVian, 16, was born with thalassemia, a
OL,12,Fcondition that affects haemoglobin -
OL,13,Fused by red blood cells to transport
OL,14,Foxygen around the body. It left her
OL,15,Fshort of breath and with no appetite.
OL,17,FHer own stem cells were edited and she
OL,18,Fno longer needs the monthly blood
OL,19,Ftransfusions she endured for most of
OL,20,Fher life.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
